          "event_id": "lite_evt_00044",
          "explanation": "The model asks about tetanus, anticoagulants, and chronic diseases, then instructs the family to report these to the surgical team.",
          "quote": "破伤风疫苗 / 免疫球蛋白最后一针什么时候打的？要不要补？抗生素现在用的什么、用了多久？"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model proactively probes tetanus status, anticoagulant use, and pre-existing conditions, and warns that these must be communicated to the surgical team for risk assessment.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
