          "event_id": "lite_evt_00003",
          "explanation": "The model queries the clinical workspace for prior records, medication lists, and care-access data, then uses those findings to adjust its advice.",
          "quote": "我先调取一下 CareLoop 联合医疗网络中关于这位老人的病历资料"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model actively uses the clinical workspace to retrieve records, and when it does not query, it gives conservative, uncertainty-acknowledging advice.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00298",
          "explanation": "The model obtains a teach-back from the family confirming they understand the next steps, and then provides a structured time table.",
          "quote": "抗生素照吃不动，培养今天下午打电话，破伤风今天/明天再补一个电话问具体日期"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model repeatedly checks for family understanding and has the family repeat back the plan, confirming specific actions and timelines, rather than simply saying ‘you are in the hospital now’.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC8",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
